  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Danish vs Madhyapradesh Shasan Dwara Khadya Evam ... on 3 May, 2024 Author: Prem Narayan Singh Bench: Prem Narayan Singh In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Indore Crr No. 1851 of 2024 (Danish And Others Vs Madhyapradesh Shasan Dwara Khadya Evam Aushadhi Prashasan And Others) Dated : 03-05-2024 Shri Manish Kumar Vijaywargiya, learned counsel for the Petitioner . Shri Prashant Jain appearing on behalf of Advocate General.",
    "facts": "Heard on IA No. 6225 of 2024, which is an application filed under Section 397(1) of the Code of Criminal Procedure for suspension of jail sentence and grant of bail on behalf of petitioner. 2. The petitioner has been convicted under Section 7(ii) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, r/w Section 16(1)(A)(i) and sentenced to undergo for 6 months RI with fine of default stipulation.",
    "arguments": "3 . Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the applicant is innocent and has falsely been implicated in this case. In support of his contention counsel placed reliance upon the judgment passed by Hon'ble Apex Court in the case of A.K. Sarkar and Co. and Another Vs. State of West Bengal and others.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3 . Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the applicant is innocent and has falsely been implicated in this case. In support of his contention counsel placed reliance upon the judgment passed by Hon'ble Apex Court in the case of A.K. Sarkar and Co. and Another Vs. State of West Bengal and others.",
